Give the stylus and mouse screen-mapping retries their own counters.

All three pointer branches incremented num_touch_mapping_tries. The stylus and
mouse guards therefore never tripped, so every pointer event remapped the
device to the screen: two blocking X round trips against the same display lock
the screen capture holds. The touch guard meanwhile ran out three times too
early. Upstream bug.

